Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Fourth Episode\NThe Madness of Alce
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All our Kings of the past\Nwere strong and courageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And all were capable\Nof performing exceptional feats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.30,0:02:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Look at these Kings,\Nhow brave they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful and courageous\Nwere the Kings of the past!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.94,0:03:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly! I told you,\Nthey were the bravest in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.22,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at how strong this one was!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- And that one there? - He caught\Nthat big whale all by himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.90,0:03:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kings of old fought\Nagainst dragons with only a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.30,0:03:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the Kings of ancient times\Nfought against a lion,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,they carried only a\Nsingle tiny spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the Kings of old\Nwere strong and very courageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- And what is Prince Sapphire like?\N- Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.70,0:04:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... He... Actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire will be our next King,\Nwon't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he also strong and courageous?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.10,0:04:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, not at all! Sapphire is\Nneither strong nor courageous!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- Because he has never performed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...an achievement so important\Nthat it can be displayed in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So he is not as good as he seems!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.34,0:04:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Princess Sapphire,\Nplease stay calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get angry, it will\Nbe trouble for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.10,0:04:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better if you go over\Nthere, I'll keep an eye on them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But in reality, he is weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray!\NSapphire is not strong at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.42,0:04:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.18,0:04:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Weak Sapphire has arrived!\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon said that you are\Nnot as brave as you seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Princess Sapphire\Nand Doctor Uranaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, why do you say that I am not\Nas brave as I seem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.02,0:05:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I only said...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you haven't had a chance\Nto prove your courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.02,0:05:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon! I will never forgive you\Nif you say unkind things...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.10,0:05:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...about\NPrincess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Princess Sapphire,\Nwhy don't you try to prove...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...your courage to Plastic?\N- Prove my courage?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a deer named Alce who lives\Nin the forest near the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He is no ordinary deer; he is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that! When hunters\Ngo looking for animals,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.42,0:05:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,he suddenly appears\Nand attacks them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He always wins and then leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.18,0:05:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that now\Neveryone is afraid of him...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.82,0:05:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and they stay away from the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.58,0:05:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you want to defeat\Nthe great deer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know there was\Nsuch a deer in the forest! All right, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.74,0:06:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Opal, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Run to the forest immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire! Where are you going?\N- Hi, Tink, I was looking for you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.90,0:06:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the forest\Nwhere a deer named Alce lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Alce...?\NYes, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Opale, let's go!\N- Sapphire, wait! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.14,0:06:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Sapphire\Nis going to that place. It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If Alce attacks him\Nhe will hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.74,0:06:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very dark in the forest! Opale,\Nstay here, I'll look for him by myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hello! Do you know Alce?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you know Alce?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.58,0:07:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's strange! Why is\Neveryone running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt me, please!\NHelp! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.58,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll teach you to laugh!\NWait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Alce, right? Because of you, no\None can come into the woods anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to defeat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go? I don't\Nwant him to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.58,0:08:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How big you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.34,0:08:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire might be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.78,0:09:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried!\NI'm worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.14,0:09:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire, did\Nyou encounter the deer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! And he knocked me to the ground\Nwith a blow from his horns!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sorry,\NPrincess Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.94,0:09:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even you can defeat him!\NBut if I had been there...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.58,0:09:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't have been able to do\Nanything at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,because Moose's head alone\Nis this big!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! His head is this big?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Prince Sapphire,\Ndid you manage to kill Moose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still alive in the woods. I'm letting him\Nlive for a few more days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see! It's not that by any chance\Nyou're a little afraid of him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Me, afraid?!\N- I mean... what I mean is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.90,0:09:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't manage to kill him\Nwhat will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.22,0:09:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will defeat him\Nwithout using my sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.34,0:09:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But when I've defeated him\Nwhat will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.58,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll stand on top of the tower\Nlike a flag! Like this! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Very interesting!\NIn the meantime, start practicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.46,0:10:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire, let's go,\Nyou must rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.38,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you did the right thing\Nby promising him such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.26,0:10:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire might even be\Ncapable of defeating Alce!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- I have a way to avoid it!\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.26,0:10:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful! If you touch\Nthe tip you will go mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.70,0:10:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It will be enough just\Nto hit him anywhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.26,0:10:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,..with this poisonous arrow\Nthat the natives of Africa use!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can't take it anymore!\N- Princess Sapphire, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.70,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is almost high,\Nit would be time to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry to throw\Nyou to the ground again!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.06,0:11:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no!\N- Is everything alright, Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The way things are going, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,.. ...that I cannot defeat\NAlce, at least not with a sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Send out more and more smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- We are ready, Mr. Nylon.\N- Alright, begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But what are you doing?\NDon't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and send the smoke\Ninto the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to drive the animals\Nout, do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.86,0:13:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon that cursed Alce\Nwill appear! Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.74,0:13:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill him..! Surround him...\NDon't let him escape..!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is truly a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.02,0:14:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But no monster\Ncould climb up this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,When he is hit by the\Narrow, he will go mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, go as wild\Nas you like!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I really want to see\Nhow Sapphire will catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If he should meet him, furious\Nas he is, he will tear him to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.62,0:15:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes Alce!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.30,0:15:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Alce, where are\Nyou going in such a hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.62,0:15:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out for the sheep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.70,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My God!\NWhat is this shiny thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.42,0:16:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Alce?\NHe seems to have gone mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.98,0:16:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Alce is running wild\Nthrough the whole city...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the soldiers\Ncannot stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.14,0:16:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So we would like you to come\Nand try, Princess Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time! I have just finished\Ndevising a way to kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If Alce has two horns, well...\NI will have three swords!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But not three hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.42,0:16:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! Do you perhaps intend\Nto throw the swords at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, my idea\Nwill work! Let's go, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.82,0:16:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she'll need a lot of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's arrived,\Nbut he's destroying the city
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.70,0:18:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Alce!\NThis time I'll get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.26,0:18:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.02,0:18:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't kill him!\NRemove the arrow he has on his neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrow?! I think Tink\Nsaid to pull out an arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.90,0:19:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!\NHurry and bring some ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.54,0:19:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly, tie the other end\Nto the tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.10,0:20:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!\NSapphire, hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.98,0:20:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Alce, open your eyes!\NSapphire has removed the arrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.42,0:20:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.34,0:21:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Moose..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.26,0:21:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A bad man shot\Na poisoned arrow at you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.66,0:21:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,but she helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She is telling you to forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the one who must apologize to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.02,0:21:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...because I intended\Nto kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.58,0:21:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray! Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see? He captured Moose!\NNow you will have to keep your promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I am sure I shot\Nthe arrow hitting him in the neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.34,0:21:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, you idiot!\NGo be the flag..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.62,0:21:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...on top of that tower!\N- Let me try again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.26,0:22:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I have another arrow! If I shoot it\Nat Alce, Sapphire will fall and die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.42,0:22:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurray!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!\NNo! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.18,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I didn't want to hit you!\NHelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.02,0:22:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just as I thought.\NSapphire is not weak at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.18,0:23:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right! He will be\Na strong and brave King!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Sapphire, will Alce have\Nreturned safe and sound to the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.90,0:23:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.22,0:23:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, Alce..\NTake care of yourself!
